OL,3,GNEWSAInside Scotland's wildcat HQ -
OL,4,A'It's like Big Brother for cats'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom behind a giant bank of screens in
OL,7,Fa small windowless room, Estelle
OL,8,FMorgan, animal team leader from the
OL,9,FSaving Wildcats partnership, is keeping
OL,10,Fan eye on the latest wildcats being
OL,11,Fbred in captivity for release into the
OL,12,FCairngorms.
OL,14,F"It's like Big Brother for cats", she
OL,15,Fsays of the 72 cameras being used to
OL,16,Fwatch over the animals in their
OL,17,Fenclosures.
OL,19,FThey are assessing whether they're
OL,20,Fhealthy and have the behavioural
OL,21,Fpotential to survive in the wild.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
